### Drone Service - create drone
POST http://localhost:8081/api/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "droneId": "DRN-001",
  "serialNumber": "CF-2026-001",
  "model": "Falcon X1",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "batteryLevel": 92,
  "maxPayloadKg": 5.5,
  "latitude": -26.1076,
  "longitude": 28.0567
}

### Drone Service - all drones
GET http://localhost:8081/api/drones

### Mission Service - create mission
POST http://localhost:8082/api/missions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Sandton",
  "destination": "Midrand",
  "payloadKg": 2.2,
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Mission Service - assign mission
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/missions/1/assign

### Mission Service - start mission
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/missions/1/start

### Telemetry Service - low battery event
POST http://localhost:8084/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "droneId": "DRN-001",
  "batteryLevel": 18,
  "latitude": -26.1,
  "longitude": 28.0,
  "altitudeMeters": 80,
  "speedKph": 42
}

### Alert Service - unresolved alerts
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alerts?acknowledged=false

### Database health
GET http://localhost:8081/ops/database
